==Strategy==
This stage shouldn't be that difficult if you are in mid-game or late-game. If you are in either of those parts of the game, just spam [[:Category:Rusher-class Cats|rushers]] and you'll win. If you are not, then kill the first Sir Seal with [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Whale Cat]] and then spawn [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cats]] or [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cats]] for the Doge Darks. Volcano Golem is not much to worry about, just a pretty standard backliner. Kill the Otta-smack-us, Celeboodles, and Jackie Pengs with more Paris Cats and [[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|Valkyrie Cat]], then chip down and eventually kill Volcano Golem to win.

